---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
import FolioLabel from '../components/folios/FolioLabel.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Notice | Hyperboards"
  description="A pre-launch overview of the information Hyperboards expects to collect through this website and how it is intended to be handled."
  noindex={true}
>
  <main class="privacy-reader" data-document-reader>
    <header class="privacy-reader__cover">
      <div class="privacy-reader__cover-grid container-wide">
        <div>
          <FolioLabel index="P" label="Privacy notice" note="Interim document / pre-launch" />
          <h1>A careful record of the information you share.</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="privacy-reader__metadata">
          <dl>
            <div><dt>Document</dt><dd>Website privacy notice</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Status</dt><dd>Interim / legal review required</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Indexing</dt><dd>Private pre-launch document</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="privacy-reader__warning section--compact">
      <aside class="container" role="note" aria-labelledby="privacy-status-title">
        <span aria-hidden="true">!</span>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Pre-launch status</p>
          <h2 id="privacy-status-title">This is a general interim notice, not a final privacy policy.</h2>
          <p>
            Before production launch, Hyperboards must confirm the responsible legal entity, privacy contact, service providers, retention periods, applicable legal bases and governing jurisdictions. Until those details are approved, this page should not be treated as a complete statement of legal rights or obligations.
          </p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-reader__document section">
      <div class="privacy-reader__layout container-wide">
        <aside class="privacy-reader__index" aria-labelledby="privacy-index-title">
          <div class="privacy-reader__thread" aria-hidden="true"><span data-reader-progress></span></div>
          <h2 id="privacy-index-title">Document index</h2>
          <nav aria-label="Privacy notice sections">
            <a href="#scope" aria-current="location">01 / Scope</a>
            <a href="#information">02 / Information submitted</a>
            <a href="#use">03 / Intended use</a>
            <a href="#sharing">04 / Sharing</a>
            <a href="#retention">05 / Retention and security</a>
            <a href="#rights">06 / Choices and rights</a>
            <a href="#contact">07 / Entity and contact</a>
          </nav>
        </aside>

        <article class="privacy-reader__copy">
          <section id="scope">
            <p class="privacy-reader__section-no">01 / Scope</p>
            <h2>Scope</h2>
            <p>
              This interim notice applies to information submitted through the Hyperboards website, including owner, intermediary and investor-relationship inquiries. It does not yet describe every practice of the entity that will operate the website.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="information">
            <p class="privacy-reader__section-no">02 / Information</p>
            <h2>Information you choose to submit</h2>
            <p>
              An inquiry may include your name, business email, phone number, company, website, industry, location, broad EBITDA range and the message you provide. Technical security records may also be generated when the form is used.
            </p>
            <div class="note">
              Please do not include customer lists, employee records, account credentials, tax records or other highly sensitive documents in an initial inquiry. A website form does not itself create a non-disclosure agreement.
            </div>
          </section>

          <section id="use">
            <p class="privacy-reader__section-no">03 / Use</p>
            <h2>How information is intended to be used</h2>
            <p>Information submitted through the website is expected to be used to:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>review and respond to an introduction;</li>
              <li>consider broad alignment with the published acquisition profile;</li>
              <li>coordinate an appropriate next conversation;</li>
              <li>protect the website, prevent misuse and maintain necessary records; and</li>
              <li>meet legal or regulatory requirements that apply to the responsible entity.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>The final notice will identify the applicable legal bases where required by law.</p>
          </section>

          <section id="sharing">
            <p class="privacy-reader__section-no">04 / Sharing</p>
            <h2>Sharing and service providers</h2>
            <p>
              Inquiry information may need to be handled by the Hyperboards team and limited service providers that support hosting, security, form delivery or professional review. The final policy must identify the relevant categories, contractual safeguards and any cross-border handling after the operating setup is confirmed.
            </p>
            <p>
              Hyperboards should not describe inquiry data as being sold or used for unrelated advertising unless the implemented data flow has been reviewed and the final notice accurately reflects it.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="retention">
            <p class="privacy-reader__section-no">05 / Retention</p>
            <h2>Retention and security</h2>
            <p>
              The production service should retain inquiry information only for an approved business, legal or security purpose and protect it with controls appropriate to its sensitivity. Specific retention periods and deletion practices remain to be confirmed before launch.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="rights">
            <p class="privacy-reader__section-no">06 / Rights</p>
            <h2>Your choices and legal rights</h2>
            <p>
              Depending on where you live, you may have rights to ask about, access, correct or delete personal information, or to object to certain uses. The final notice will explain which rights apply, how to exercise them and any appeal or regulator-contact process required by the governing jurisdiction.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section id="contact">
            <p class="privacy-reader__section-no">07 / Contact</p>
            <h2>Responsible entity and privacy contact</h2>
            <p>
              The legal name and address of the responsible entity, together with a monitored privacy email or other contact channel, have not yet been approved for publication. These are launch-blocking details and must replace this interim disclosure before the website is publicly indexed or used to collect production inquiries.
            </p>
          </section>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <CtaBand
    eyebrow="Before you share details"
    title="Start with only the broad facts."
    body="The inquiry page explains what is useful at the introduction stage and what should wait for a protected conversation."
    href="/contact"
    label="Review contact guidance"
  />
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  import { initSectionTracker } from '../scripts/folio-controls';

  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-document-reader]').forEach((reader) => {
    initSectionTracker(reader);
    const sections = [...reader.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.privacy-reader__copy > section')];
    const progress = reader.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-reader-progress]');
    if (!progress || !('IntersectionObserver' in window)) return;

    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      const active = entries.find((entry) => entry.isIntersecting);
      if (!active) return;
      const index = sections.indexOf(active.target as HTMLElement);
      progress.style.transform = `scaleY(${Math.max(1, index + 1) / sections.length})`;
    }, { rootMargin: '-20% 0px -65% 0px' });

    sections.forEach((section) => observer.observe(section));
  });
</script>

<style>
  .privacy-reader {
    background-color: var(--color-paper);
    background-image: var(--texture-paper);
  }

  .privacy-reader__cover {
    padding: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 8.5rem) 0;
    background-color: var(--color-midnight);
    background-image: var(--texture-leather);
    background-blend-mode: screen, normal, soft-light;
  }

  .privacy-reader__cover-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    align-items: end;
  }

  .privacy-reader h1 {
    max-width: 12ch;
    margin-top: 2.2rem;
    color: var(--color-white);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 7.2rem);
    line-height: 0.92;
  }

  .privacy-reader__metadata {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(199, 168, 91, 0.4);
    color: rgba(251, 250, 246, 0.68);
  }

  .privacy-reader__metadata dl {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .privacy-reader__metadata div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 6rem 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(251, 250, 246, 0.1);
  }

  .privacy-reader__metadata div:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .privacy-reader__metadata dt { color: var(--color-brass-light); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.58rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .privacy-reader__metadata dd { margin: 0; font-size: 0.8rem; }

  .privacy-reader__warning {
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    background: #ebe5d8;
  }

  .privacy-reader__warning aside {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 1.4rem;
    padding: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    border: 1px solid rgba(199, 168, 91, 0.52);
    background: rgba(251, 250, 246, 0.48);
    box-shadow: var(--paper-tile-shadow);
  }

  .privacy-reader__warning aside > span {
    display: grid;
    width: 2.6rem;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    place-items: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-brass-dark);
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: var(--color-brass-dark);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .privacy-reader__warning h2 { max-width: 24ch; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 3rem); }
  .privacy-reader__warning p:last-child { max-width: 57rem; color: var(--color-slate); }

  .privacy-reader__layout {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 8rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .privacy-reader__index {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .privacy-reader__index h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .privacy-reader__index nav { display: grid; }
  .privacy-reader__index a { padding: 0.62rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(11, 27, 54, 0.1); color: var(--color-slate); font-size: 0.75rem; text-decoration: none; }
  .privacy-reader__index a[aria-current='location'] { color: var(--color-midnight); font-weight: 700; }

  .privacy-reader__thread {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 1px;
    background: rgba(11, 27, 54, 0.13);
  }

  .privacy-reader__thread span {
    display: block;
    width: 3px;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--color-brass-dark);
    transform: scaleY(0.1428);
    transform-origin: top;
    transition: transform 260ms var(--ease-out);
  }

  .privacy-reader__copy { max-width: 50rem; }
  .privacy-reader__copy section { scroll-margin-top: 7rem; }
  .privacy-reader__copy section + section { margin-top: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 7rem); padding-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(11, 27, 54, 0.15); }
  .privacy-reader__section-no { color: var(--color-forest); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.65rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .privacy-reader__copy h2 { max-width: 21ch; margin-block: 0.8rem 1.5rem; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.8rem); }
  .privacy-reader__copy p, .privacy-reader__copy li { color: var(--color-slate); line-height: 1.75; }

  @media (min-width: 64rem) {
    .privacy-reader__cover-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(19rem, 0.5fr); }
    .privacy-reader__layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(13rem, 0.32fr) minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .privacy-reader__index { position: sticky; top: 7rem; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 38rem) {
    .privacy-reader__warning aside { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .privacy-reader h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 14.5vw, 4.7rem); }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .privacy-reader__thread span { transition: none; }
  }
</style>
